Dictionary with istances of largest connected component (LCC) of Erdos Renyi Model as nx.Graph objects

For each number of nodes(of the LCC)  N = 512, 1024, 2048, 4096, 8192
For each average degree(aproximately) k = 2, 4, 6, 8 
There are 20 different istances indexed with range(20)

Data is in a form of dictionary with keys as tuples (number_of_nodes, average_degree, istance_number)

#EXAMPE
#iterates through all istances of LCC of ER (as nx.Graph objects) for k=2, N=512 in the data

import pickle
with open("ER_graphs.pkl", "rb") as f:
    dictionary = pickle.load(f)
    
for i in range(20):
    dictionary((512,2,i))
